<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About - BilupTheme</title>
    <script src="/static/js/lucide.js"></script>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('../partials/nav', { ...locals }) %>

    <main class="main-content">
        <div class="page-header">
            <h1>About BilupTheme</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Learn more about this platform</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-content">
            <section class="about-section">
                <h2>What is BilupTheme?</h2>
                <p>BilupTheme is a platform for browsing and sharing custom themes for your favorite mods. Whether you're looking to personalize your experience or share your creations with the community, BilupTheme makes it easy to discover and customize themes.</p>
            </section>
            <section class="about-section">
                <h2>Features</h2>
                <ul class="feature-list">
                    <li><i data-lucide="palette"></i> Browse a wide variety of themes</li>
                    <li><i data-lucide="upload"></i> Upload and share your own themes</li>
                    <li><i data-lucide="heart"></i> Like and save your favorites</li>
                    <li><i data-lucide="users"></i> Connect with other creators</li>
                </ul>
            </section>
            <section class="about-section">
                <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
                <p>Have questions or suggestions? Feel free to reach out!</p>
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                    <a href="https://github.com/Bilup/BilupTheme/issues" class="btn primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        <i data-lucide="message-circle"></i>
                        Contact on Github
                    </a>
                    <a href="https://qm.qq.com/q/HGvdC8WfGC" class="btn secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        <i data-lucide="message-circle"></i>
                        Contact on QQ
                    </a>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('../partials/footer', { ...locals }) %>
    <script>lucide.createIcons();</script>
</body>
</html>
